{"id":"pozdnij","lemma":"поздний","pos":"adj","rank":4712,"glosses":["late"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a7/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"позднее","neuter":"позднее","feminine":"поздняя","plural":"поздние"},"examples":[{"text":"Мы сделаем это позднее.","en":"We'll do this later.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Я перезвоню позднее.","en":"I'll call again later.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to ring again","l":"перезвонить"},null]},{"text":"Прошу прощения за поздний ответ.","en":"I apologize for the late reply.","words":[{"g":"to ask for, to request","l":"просить"},{"g":"forgiveness, pardon","l":"прощение"},{"g":"behind / for"},null,{"g":"answer"}]},{"text":"Возможно, мы можем обсудить это позднее.","en":"Perhaps we can discuss this later.","words":[{"g":"perhaps"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to discuss"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Когда мы вернулись, была уже поздняя ночь.","en":"It was late at night when we got back.","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to return","l":"вернуться"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"already"},null,{"g":"night, nighttime"}]}]}